## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-idempotent producer sketch
function publishEvent(tenantId, event) {
  const key = tenantId + ':' + event.id;
  if (Redis.setIfNotExists(key, '1', { EX: TTL_SECONDS })) {
    kinesisClient.putRecord({ Data: JSON.stringify(event), PartitionKey: tenantId });
