## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: idempotent sink to DynamoDB
async function sink(event) {
  const key = `${event.deviceId}#${event.ts}`;
  const existing = await getItem(key);
  if (existing) return; // idempotent: skip duplicates
  await putItem({ ...event, id: key });
}
```

